## Phase exit checklist

Closeout is an event, not a sub-phase. Run before declaring the phase
complete:

- [ ] `references/DRIFT-CHECK.md` ran clean (or drift recorded in `SPEC.md §B` / `AUDIT.md` detail)
- [ ] Final coverage / contract / drift sweep green
- [ ] `SPEC.md §B` finding ledger reflects landed commits
- [ ] Runtime task list shows zero `in_progress`
- [ ] Closeout note written: `.scratchpad/dossier/closeout/phase-{PHASE}-{slug}.md`
      (skip for trivial phases ≤ 2 commits unless flavor is `migration` or `release-hardening`)
